a06d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Support Without Strain", "children": [{"id": "85b34b2e-ad24-4cf2-9510-f91f6c1c7e4e", "type": "concept", "title": "Released onset"}, {"id": "13276150-2e53-4aec-ab25-f0809dfbdc6f", "type": "concept", "title": "Sustained sound"}, {"id": "250c42d9-6c24-472d-b342-e5c4aa8c8a3c", "type": "concept", "title": "Projection versus pushing"}], "description": "Students practice usable volume and stamina while protecting the voice."}]}, {"id": "42578007-2438-400e-b4b6-b6a684872824", "type": "topic", "title": "Vocal Production and Resonance", "description": "Students explore how sound travels through the body and space. Resonance work expands range, color, and expressive possibility.", "children": [{"id": "279c0667-cc38-4efd-997d-b60e9a4823e9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sound Source and Onset", "children": [{"id": "48eee72d-722b-4385-8472-3f8ea752cb86", "type": "concept", "title": "Gentle onset"}, {"id": "aa1d4b06-82d3-4de8-97d1-f2e6884d7a37", "type": "concept", "title": "Vocal fold awareness"}, {"id": "96079d03-86c9-4c1b-a626-12bffe48c034", "type": "concept", "title": "Hum, sigh, and open sound"}], "description": "Actors learn how tone begins and how to avoid harsh or breathy habits."}, {"id": "197a102c-fccf-4b18-9a5d-a954ac4d58e4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Resonating Spaces", "children": [{"id": "1205a92e-33fa-4c28-be52-578396ce6de3", "type": "concept", "title": "Chest, mouth, nasal, mask, and head resonance"}, {"id": "a6d1e813-8692-4254-a515-56975f472233", "type": "concept", "title": "Vocal color and emotional tone"}, {"id": "baed8613-f045-497b-ac31-61b3cc82a762", "type": "concept", "title": "Resonance shifts for character and space"}], "description": "The gist is to discover vibration as a physical experience."}, {"id": "fa8194f3-fc20-4991-be97-5eb80139b2cb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Range and Flexibility", "children": [{"id": "0473e239-ac6c-4b6d-b0ce-18648ae712df", "type": "concept", "title": "Pitch, volume, tempo, and rhythm"